  "title": "Utility of 2-Methoxyethanol in the Synthesis of Polyeuropium Complexes: {[Eu(OCH2CH2OMe)2(OC6H3R2-2,6)-][H+]}4 (R = Me, iPr) and [EuAl2(OCH2CH2OMe)3Me5]2",
